{"source_id": "baike_2e5a5841b0c0", "title": "四大名旦", "url": "http://baike.baidu.com/view/37618.htm", "source_type": "baidu", "publisher": "百度百科", "published_at": null, "fetched_at": "2026-05-31T15:19:31.073547", "content": "京剧四大名旦指梅兰芳、程砚秋、尚小云、荀慧生四位旦角表演艺术家，他们是京剧旦行四大流派的创始人。1927年北平《顺天时报》举办“五大名伶新剧夺魁投票”，梅兰芳《太真外传》、尚小云《摩登伽女》、程砚秋《红拂传》、荀慧生《丹青引》、徐碧云《绿珠》胜出。1931年四人合作灌制《四五花洞》唱片，同年上海《戏剧月刊》通过征文评选确立“四大名旦”称号。抗战期间，梅兰芳编演《抗金兵》《生死恨》并蓄须明志拒为日伪演出，程砚秋归隐务农拒唱义务戏，荀慧生赴前线慰问将士并多次义演捐献，尚小云变卖家产创办荣春社培养人才。四位艺术家形成独特艺术风格：梅派融合青衣、花旦、刀马旦特色，代表剧目《贵妃醉酒》《霸王别姬》；尚派以文武兼备著称，创演《梁红玉》《双阳公主》；程派创立幽咽婉转唱腔体系，代表剧目《锁麟囊》《春闺梦》；荀派创造融合韵白与京白的“谐白”，塑造红娘、金玉奴等角色。四人代表剧目《虹霓关》于近年推出新版本。武... 基本信息：m203_name: 京剧四大名旦<sup>1</sup><a name=\"ref_1\"></a>；m203_member: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%A2%85%E5%85%B0%E8%8A%B3/10991\" data-lemmaid=\"10991\">梅兰芳</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E7%A8%8B%E7%A0%9A%E7%A7%8B/73669\" data-lemmaid=\"73669\">程砚秋</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E5%B0%9A%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%91/774371\" data-lemmaid=\"774371\">尚小云</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E8%8D%80%E6%85%A7%E7%94%9F/63483\" data-lemmaid=\"63483\">荀慧生</a>；m203_majorWorks: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E8%B4%B5%E5%A6%83%E9%86%89%E9%85%92/825468\" data-lemmaid=\"825468\">贵妃醉酒</a>(梅兰芳)<sup>4</sup><a name=\"ref_4\"></a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%B1%89%E6%98%8E%E5%A6%83/6452723\" data-lemmaid=\"6452723\">汉明妃</a>(尚小云)<sup>4</sup><a name=\"ref_4\"></a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E9%94%81%E9%BA%9F%E5%9B%8A/4974821\" data-lemmaid=\"4974821\">锁麟囊</a>(程砚秋)<sup>4</sup><a name=\"ref_4\"></a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A8%98/9241296\" data-lemmaid=\"9241296\">红娘</a>(荀慧生)<sup>4</sup><a name=\"ref_4\"></a>；m203_occupation: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E4%BA%AC%E5%89%A7%E6%BC%94%E5%91%98/5509659\" data-lemmaid=\"5509659\">京剧演员</a><sup>1</sup><a name=\"ref_1\"></a>；m203_nationality: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/22516505\" data-lemmaid=\"22516505\">中国</a><sup>3</sup><a name=\"ref_3\"></a>；m203_customDefault: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%B0%91%E5%9B%BD/2209725\" data-lemmaid=\"2209725\">民国</a><sup>1</sup><a name=\"ref_1\"></a>；m203_customDefault: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%97%A6%E8%A7%92/1139163\" data-lemmaid=\"1139163\">旦角</a>", "trust_level": 4, "language": "zh-CN", "authors": [], "metadata": {"retriever": "BaiduCultureRetriever", "keyword": "京剧四大名旦", "match_score": 4, "content_chars": 1937, "has_url": true, "source_rank_reason": "ranked by trust, recency and content length"}}
